==German==
===Etymology===
Compound of  [[halb]] "half" + [[Kugel]] "sphere", a loan translation of Latin [[hemisphaerium]], attested in scientific or technical literature from ca. the 1790s.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|plural=Halbkugeln}}

# [[hemisphere]], half of any sphere

====Synonyms====
*{{sense|half of the Earth}} [[Hemisphäre]]
 

